# A firmware that does not navigate through layout and punctuation: SpaceAfter and punct are refused before they
# are scored (Semantics: Personality firmware, "What was measured on one entity"). The standings stay as they are;
# the program's own firmware keeps these strands, and this one does not.
k 2
lambda 0.05
hops 8
top always
order witness
refuse predicate SpaceAfter punct

for hop
  fan 4096

for search
  fan 512

for translate
  fan 4096
  lexicalization wn-lmf Sense language ili
  gloss wn-lmf Definition
  # a language as every code set writes it: the codes ISO 639-3's table states are one language's (en, eng)
  equivalent iso-639-3 Part1 Part2b Part2t

for pull
  fan 4096
  take fact
  take segment
  take attestations 3
  take constituents 1
